 "credits": {
  "de": "Backsteinwand, Rahmen, Lampen und die Bilder Muur, Flandrien, Plakat und Lautsprecherwagen: mit FLUX.2 [klein] 4B (Apache-2.0) erzeugt und nachbearbeitet; Ort und Rennen auf dem Plakat sind erfunden. Die Fotos in den Rahmen sind meine eigenen.",
  "en": "Brick wall, frames, lamps and the pictures Muur, flandrien, poster and loudspeaker car: made with FLUX.2 [klein] 4B (Apache-2.0) and reworked; the town and the race on the poster are invented. The photos in the frames are my own."
 },
 "look": {
  "houseTint": "#ffe2bd",
  "note": "the mocks (1440 x 900, 1920 x 1080) use the GL lamp as it is (house 0.14), this warmer house tint, the four picture lamps (lights[] with their fixtures[]) and a soft bloom around the bulbs and the lamp pool (light above 0.6, blurred 18 u and 60 u, added at 0.6). Bulb glow: fixtures[].glow"
 },
